lor-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Equip</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_bonus\" title=\"Armor bonus\">Armor Bonus</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><table border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td>Adamantine Body:</td><td align=\"right\"><b>+8</b></td></tr><tr><td>Mithral Body:</td><td align=\"right\"><b>+4</b></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Maximum Dexterity Bonus\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_check_penalty\" title=\"Armor check penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Arcane_spell_failure\" title=\"Arcane spell failure\">Arcane Spell Failure</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">80\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px